  <p class="pergola-source-note"><strong>Manufacturer feature sources, checked 4 November 2026:</strong>
    <a href="https://pergolux.au/products/pergola" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pergola 4 specifications</a>,{" "}
